/E (Some issues were visual, such as inconsistent typography and poorly sized components. Others were structural, such as conditional scenes appearing at incorrect points or players being asked questions that contradicted their earlier actions.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
173 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 58 0 R
/E (I addressed these issues by breaking them into smaller, testable requirements and refining Codex instructions through multiple iterations.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
174 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 58 0 R
/E (A further challenge was integrating two versions with different strengths. This required identifying which elements should be retained from each version and establishing clear priorities between visual consistency and updated gameplay logic.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
175 0 obj
<<
